# ERA — coverage definition (honest done)

## Source of truth

| Layer | Document |
|-------|----------|
| Actor matrix (Doc/API/UI × roles) | `docs/COVERAGE_MATRIX.md` |
| Engineering checklists | `era-*/doc/DELIVERY*.md` |
| Nafta pilot gaps | `docs/NAFTA_DOC_API_UI_AUDIT.md` |
| UAT usability | `docs/LOCAL_UAT_GAP_CHECKLIST.md` |
| Integration boundaries (MDM/hub/workforce) | `docs/INTEGRATION_AUDIT_CI.md` — `npm run audit:integration:strict` before SHIPPED on MDM/reference rows |
| UI pattern | `docs/UI_PLAYBOOK_SATELLITES.md` |

**DELIVERY checkbox % ≠ SHIPPED.** READINESS_MATRIX §6 applies.

## Status taxonomy

| Status | DELIVERY tag | When to use |
|--------|--------------|-------------|
| **SHIPPED** | `[x]` | Doc + API + UI for declared actor + UAT-SMOKE UI step (no curl-only) |
| **API** | `[~]` | Backend/route exists; admin or ops UI deferred |
| **STUB** | `[s]` | Mock vendor / NBC / notify / e-qaimé |
| **HEADLESS** | `[h]` | Workers, webhooks, event consumers — ADR link required |
| **BLOCKED** | `[ ]` | External file/creds/cert |

## Actor columns (pick per capability)

| Actor | Scope |
|-------|--------|
| **OpsUI** | Local login staff (`/login`, reception, floor) |
| **SatAdmin** | Satellite `/admin/*`, `CLINIC_ADMIN`, `Hotel_Admin` |
| **OrgOwner** | SSO `BUSINESS_OWNER`, `/workspace`, `/executive` |
| **SuperAdmin** | Orch `/super-admin/*`, platform-only routes |

## Anti-patterns (do not merge)

- `[x]` on «справочник / master data» without SatAdmin list + modal CRUD
- MODULES_CATALOG **DONE** without COVERAGE_MATRIX row
- NAFTA audit **OK** when only API exists
- UAT-SMOKE steps that require curl for ops flows marked SHIPPED

## Definition of done (feature)

1. COVERAGE_MATRIX row updated (ID + actor columns)
2. DELIVERY tag matches status (`[x]` only for SHIPPED/HEADLESS)
3. UAT-SMOKE UI path for SHIPPED ops/admin flows
4. Module-map `.mdc` route listed
5. i18n en + az + ru for new screens
